# Packed game archives are binary. Git guesses this correctly today, but the guess is per-blob and
# a WolvenKit repack could produce one it reads as text -- at which point CRLF conversion would
# corrupt it silently on checkout, and the symptom would be a mod that simply does not load.
*.archive   binary
*.dtex      binary
*.ent       binary
*.dxil      binary
wabbajack/*.json text eol=lf
